                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e6d2f0fa-1453-3ccd-8d8b-84a22c2014bc",
                        "entry_id": "5e87f27e-a931-3b34-b8a7-92916ba6fe9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sufficient supply (of)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "obsolete",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ce5e2d90-3213-4102-b9bb-727e9a8b28f7",
                                "sense_id": "e6d2f0fa-1453-3ccd-8d8b-84a22c2014bc",
                                "text": "the next day they returned unsuspected, leaving their confederates to follow, and in the interim, to convay them a competencie of all things they could […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "be563f4c-a982-413f-bee6-6d0e1797ea98",
                                "sense_id": "e6d2f0fa-1453-3ccd-8d8b-84a22c2014bc",
                                "text": "[…] it would appear that before taking this precaution Mr. Bree must have had the thrift to remove a modest competency of the gold […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "48482b57-6f15-3e83-a579-5ed1a8f21d41",
                        "entry_id": "5e87f27e-a931-3b34-b8a7-92916ba6fe9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A sustainable income."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "obsolete",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3fc95cab-7433-43f1-822d-1306a0f725a4",
                                "sense_id": "48482b57-6f15-3e83-a579-5ed1a8f21d41",
                                "text": "Superfluity comes sooner by white hairs, but competency lives longer."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c3afd3f4-d036-47d3-a1fa-c8ee4167f8a1",
                                "sense_id": "48482b57-6f15-3e83-a579-5ed1a8f21d41",
                                "text": "And that knights competency you haue gotten / VVith care and labour: he vvith luſt and idleneſſe / VVill bring into the ſtypend of a begger; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3bc93596-a40f-4fc3-b4fb-714eaf82d401",
                                "sense_id": "48482b57-6f15-3e83-a579-5ed1a8f21d41",
                                "text": "He had heard people speak contemptuously of money: he wondered if they had ever tried to do without it. He knew that the lack made a man petty, mean, grasping; it distorted his character and caused him to view the world from a vulgar angle; when you had to consider every penny, money became of grotesque importance: you needed a competency to rate it at its proper value."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "53f295cb-ca38-33be-9db6-56b0ffd629d6",
                        "entry_id": "5e87f27e-a931-3b34-b8a7-92916ba6fe9c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The ability to perform some task; competence."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "71157181-d2ca-4b6a-bde8-db15fd026eb0",
                                "sense_id": "53f295cb-ca38-33be-9db6-56b0ffd629d6",
                                "text": "The loan demonstrates, in regard to instrumental resources, the competency of this kingdom to the assertion of the common cause."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7e7902cf-3d7e-4996-8bc2-bdcadfafc4df",
                                "sense_id": "53f295cb-ca38-33be-9db6-56b0ffd629d6",
                                "text": "What professional competencies do science teachers need?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1359254c-1a2c-4192-9dd1-dcb6146b285e",
                                "sense_id": "53f295cb-ca38-33be-9db6-56b0ffd629d6",
                                "text": "By the year 2000, American students will leave grades four, eight, and twelve having demonstrated competency in challenging subject matter including English, mathematics, science, history, and geography...."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc2eab88-5b3c-4980-834e-4cb0f443bb88",
                                "sense_id": "53f295cb-ca38-33be-9db6-56b0ffd629d6",
                                "text": "The decision was then made to return '91s' and Mk 4s. These are being retained on the Yorkshire routes to keep driver competency in one area, to help with operations."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "91a816fc-4550-3ef1-a533-e556b0d11bb2",
                        "entry_id": "5e87f27e-a931-3b34-b8a7-92916ba6fe9c",
